sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio as Chat / Evidence UI
    participant API as PaperController
    participant Conversation as ConversationService
    participant Resolver as SourceQuoteResolver
    participant Access as PaperAccessService
    participant MySQL
    participant Preview as PDF Preview Loader

    User->>Folio: click persisted citation [n]
    Folio->>API: GET /papers/reference-detail<br/>conversationRecordId + referenceNumber
    API->>Conversation: findReferenceDetail(userId, recordId, n)
    Conversation->>MySQL: load conversation by recordId + owner
    Conversation->>MySQL: parse persisted reference mapping
    alt mapping contains sourceQuoteRef
        Conversation->>Resolver: resolveRegisteredCurrentQuote
        Resolver->>MySQL: require quote registered to conversation
        Resolver->>MySQL: require Source Quote in current READY model
        Resolver-->>Conversation: authoritative paper, location, pages, source span
    else legacy mapping
        Conversation->>Conversation: normalize persisted detail
    end
    API->>Access: recheck current paper access
    alt unauthorized, stale, or missing
        API-->>Folio: 403 or 404 without opening evidence
    else valid detail
        API-->>Folio: authoritative reference detail
        Folio->>Preview: open PDF at page + evidence region
        Note over Folio,Preview: Byte-range PDF loading continues in the PDF Evidence Runtime
    end
